d":"b3-005-004","sourceId":"b3-005-004","sourceIndex":3,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,16],"wordModel":"english-ctc-fallback","text":"When the article arrived, the editor read the first sentence and then refused to publish it.","start":38.74,"end":44.78,"score":0.972,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-005-005","sourceId":"b3-005-005","sourceIndex":4,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,15],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"The article began:'Hundreds of steps lead to the high wall which surrounds the president's palace.'","start":45.88,"end":53.11,"score":0.97,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-005-006-p01","sourceId":"b3-005-006","sourceIndex":5,"part":1,"parts":2,"wordRange":[0,19],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"The editor at once sent the journalist a fax instructing him to find out the exact number of steps","start":53.94,"end":61.22,"score":0.964,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-005-006-p02","sourceId":"b3-005-006","sourceIndex":5,"part":2,"parts":2,"wordRange":[19,25],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"and the height of the wall.","start":61.6,"end":62.8,"score":0.935,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-005-007","sourceId":"b3-005-007","sourceIndex":6,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,19],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"The journalist immediately set out to obtain these important facts, but he took a long time to send them.","start":64.44,"end":71.27,"score":0.962,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-005-008","sourceId":"b3-005-008","sourceIndex":7,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,14],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"Meanwhile, the editor was getting impatient, for the magazine would soon go to press.","start":71.89,"end":77.81,"score":0.988,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-005-009","sourceId":"b3-005-009","sourceIndex":8,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,11],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"He sent the journalist two more faxes, but received no reply.","start":78.78,"end":83.57,"score":0.767,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-005-010","sourceId":"b3-005-010","sourceIndex":9,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,19],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"He sent yet another fax informing the journalist that if he did not reply soon he would be fired.","start":84.54,"end":91.47,"score":0.971,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-005-011","sourceId":"b3-005-011","sourceIndex":10,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,19],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"When the journalist again failed to reply,  the editor reluctantly published the article as it had originally been written.","start":92.45,"end":101.32,"score":0.98,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-005-012","sourceId":"b3-005-012","sourceIndex":11,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,13],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"A week later, the editor at last received a fax from the journalist.","start":102.36,"end":106.84,"score":0.954,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-005-013","sourceId":"b3-005-013","sourceIndex":12,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,17],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"Not only had the poor man been arrested, but he had been sent to prison as well.","start":107.94,"end":112.91,"score":0.969,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-005-014-p01","sourceId":"b3-005-014","sourceIndex":13,"part":1,"parts":3,"wordRange":[0,17],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"However, he had at last been allowed to send a fax in which he informed the editor","start":113.7,"end":119.11,"score":0.948,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-005-014-p02","sourceId":"b3-005-014","sourceIndex":13,"part":2,"parts":3,"wordRange":[17,26],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"that he had been arrested while counting the 1,","start":119.44,"end":122.66,"score":0.939,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-005-014-p03","sourceId":"b3-005-014","sourceIndex":13,"part":3,"parts":3,"wordRange":[26,39],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"084 steps leading to the 15th foot wall which surrounded the president's palace.","start":123.52,"end":129.76,"score":0.91,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]}]}
